WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.319 --> 00:00:04.039
Many children have no food to eat

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.720
and these children are starving for an education!

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:17.360
It is alarming that 57 million children

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.239
are deprived of education.

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.959
They cannot go to school.

00:00:21.159 --> 00:00:23.119
This must shake our conscience.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.959
Girls have been the target of sexual violence

00:00:27.039 --> 00:00:29.759
and abuse and they are only limited

00:00:29.839 --> 00:00:32.000
to the four walls of their houses.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:34.400
There is no freedom.

00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:38.079
But still, there is hope.

00:00:38.759 --> 00:00:43.119
I'm hopeful the European Parliament

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:49.079
will look beyond Europe, to the suffering countries

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:53.800
where people are still deprived of their basic rights.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.800
The powerful country should not be judged

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:02.200
by counting its soldiers and Navy.

00:01:05.439 --> 00:01:10.039
But rather, we must see which country

00:01:10.119 --> 00:01:11.959
has the highest literacy rate,

00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:15.560
which country has more educated people,

00:01:15.639 --> 00:01:19.519
which country has provided the basic rights to its citizens.

00:01:23.079 --> 00:01:30.479
A country with talented, skillful and educated people

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.400
is the real superpower,

00:01:32.479 --> 00:01:36.239
not the country with tons of soldiers and weapons.

00:01:37.439 --> 00:01:42.839
I'm hopeful that through our unity and determination,

00:01:43.720 --> 00:01:45.479
we can achieve our goals

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:50.639
and help those 57 million children

00:01:51.319 --> 00:01:52.879
who are waiting for us.

00:01:54.319 --> 00:01:58.959
And these children, they do not want an iPhone,

00:01:59.039 --> 00:02:02.119
an Xbox, a PlayStation or chocolates.

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:06.680
They just want a book and a pen.

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:08.159
Thank you so much.

